Testing that fw4 zones, forwardings and rules declared ephemerally through
procd service data (service get_data type firewall) are synthesized with their
declared names, resolve against uci zones in both directions, that an entry
without a type field remains inert, and that a malformed zone is skipped with
a diagnostic while the rest of the ruleset stays intact.

